lsvp-goop:greenhouse:5845383004.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;page&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;layoutArea&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;layoutArea&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;column&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;goop&amp;nbsp;is a lifestyle platform dedicated to exploration, curation, and groundbreaking conversation. From its award-winning beauty and fashion lines to its expansive editorial lens, goop invites women to embrace the process of becoming, and to discover deep joy in the pursuit of pleasure, beauty, and growth in all phases of life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Gwyneth Paltrow began goop in the fall of 2008 as a weekly newsletter. It has expanded into a beauty, fashion, and food business&amp;nbsp;that’s&amp;nbsp;also known for its products, curation, podcast, TV shows, live events, and retail stores.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You have a&amp;nbsp;passion for&amp;nbsp;cultivating&amp;nbsp;clientele&amp;nbsp;relationships and&amp;nbsp;developing&amp;nbsp;a deep&amp;nbsp;knowledge&amp;nbsp;and appreciation&amp;nbsp;of the&amp;nbsp;goop&amp;nbsp;brand&amp;nbsp;and aesthetic.&amp;nbsp;You are curious by nature&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;an affinity for&amp;nbsp;interacting with&amp;nbsp;customers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;anticipating&amp;nbsp;their needs.&amp;nbsp;You enjoy the luxury environment and are excited to immerse others&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As&amp;nbsp;a Keyholder, you&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;responsible&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;delivering on&amp;nbsp;the goop client expectations, and&amp;nbsp;growing the clientele&amp;nbsp;through strong client relationships&amp;nbsp;developed through&amp;nbsp;understanding the community in which the store is&amp;nbsp;located.&amp;nbsp;You are&amp;nbsp;confident in&amp;nbsp;cash reconciliation as well as opening and closing the store on a rotational basis.&amp;nbsp;You strive to not only hit your personal&amp;nbsp;sales goals but&amp;nbsp;are excited to&amp;nbsp;play an integral leadership role in the store meeting and exceeding their goals as well.&amp;nbsp;Passionate, eloquent, and confident,&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;create&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;goop environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Responsibilities include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create a warm and welcoming in-store environment, while&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;instore visual standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Maintain an effective clientele&amp;nbsp;book,&amp;nbsp;understanding&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;surrounding community&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;catering&amp;nbsp;to the demographic of potential clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Learn the details of the product&amp;nbsp;assortment&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;successfully communicate&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;finest details&amp;nbsp;to clients, both current and new.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Able to handle transfers and return to vendors, while&amp;nbsp;filing necessary paperwork.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Handle in store RTV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;’&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;s, damages, etc. when necessary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Handle weekly bank&amp;nbsp;deposit&amp;nbsp;as necessary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;2-4+&amp;nbsp;years of retail experience, preferrable within a luxury environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;interpersonal&amp;nbsp;and communication skills, both written and verbal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to perform effective selling techniques to achieve sales and repeat business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Basic computer skills&amp;nbsp;and familiarity with&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Microsoft&amp;nbsp;Suite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Physical requirements: lift / carry / move 40lbs. minimum including fixtures and product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;a flexible schedule including holidays, overnights, and weekends to meet the needs of the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;FAQ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Compensation: $24-$26/ hour + Equity + commission plan. This is a full-time, non-exempt position. Please note that this range represents the low and high end of the anticipated base salary range for the Sag Harbor, NY based position. Goop, in good faith, reasonably expects to pay the position within this salary range. Goop provides the salary range in compliance with all applicable federal, state and local laws. The actual base salary will depend on numerous factors such as: experience, training, knowledge and skills, and if the location of the job changes. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Benefits: Generous health benefits package, fertility benefits and paid parental leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Perks:&amp;nbsp;Generous goop discounts, special offers with brand partners, access to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;custom lifestyle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;and events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;goop is an Equal Opportunity Employer. goop does not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, non-disqualifying physical or mental disability, national origin, veteran status or any other basis covered by appropriate law. All employment is decided on the basis of qualifications, merit, and business need. All information provided by the applicant is collected, stored and processed in accordance with the terms of our &lt;a href=&quot;https://goop-img.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Goop-CCPA-Notice-to-Job-Candidates.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CCPA Notice for Job Candidates. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;J&lt;em&gt;ob Disclosures: No applicant disclosures related to physical requirements or ADA-related considerations are relevant for this role.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

lsvp-helsing:greenhouse:4390825101.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helsing is a defence AI company. Our mission is to protect our democracies. We aim to achieve technological leadership, so that open societies can continue to make sovereign decisions and control their ethical standards.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As democracies, we believe we have a special responsibility to be thoughtful about the development and deployment of powerful technologies like AI. We take this responsibility seriously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are an ambitious and committed team of engineers, AI specialists and customer-facing programme managers.&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are looking for mission-driven people to join our European teams – and apply their skills to solve the most complex and impactful problems. We embrace an open and transparent culture that welcomes healthy debates on the use of technology in defence, its benefits, and its ethical implications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11084&quot;&gt;As a Field Engineer at Helsing, you will play a crucial role in maturing Helsing&#39;s cutting-edge military AI products from proof-of-concept to large-scale rollout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11251&quot;&gt;You will be testing combined software and hardware products throughout the product development lifecycle in collaboration with world-class software and AI engineers, product managers, and end users as part of a tight iteration loop. You will ultimately help to assure Helsing’s products, to demonstrate that they are safe and reliable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;You’ll-do-great-if-you….3&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;15247&quot;&gt;The day-to-day&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Testing combined software and hardware products end-to-end in the lab and in the field (including flying drones), capturing data, and providing feedback to Helsing’s software and AI engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Packing equipment, transporting it to the test locations (e.g., airfields), setting it up, performing tests, and then packing up at the end of the day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Installing AI software onto edge computing devices, using Helsing&#39;s in-house deployment tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Helping to design and improve test plans and safety SOPs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Defining and securing the resources we need to maintain an effective and efficient field testing operation, and helping to secure them. For example, this may include purchasing hardware, trialling new software tools for inventory management and QA, establishing new secure storage facilities, and preparing safety cases and submissions to aviation authorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advising on training course design and in-service support procedures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel to other testing locations in the UK, France, Germany, and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;You’ll-do-great-if-you….3&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;15247&quot;&gt;You should apply if you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;14067&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a strong technical aptitude and natural curiosity. You can understand complex hardware and software products at a systems level (not necessarily at the code level). You are not satisfied until you understand how something works (or why it does not work).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;14328&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have excellent written and verbal communication skills. You can write clear and concise documentation and speak fluently about technical concepts with engineers and non-engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;14511&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are a natural problem solver. Can independently own critical workstreams, identify problems, and take the initiative to solve them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;14646&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are passionate about protecting liberal democratic values by contributing to the defense and security sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience flying drones (especially fixed-wings), possession of pilot licences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;14907&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience testing software and/or hardware products, at any stage of maturity (from prototype to production system).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;15134&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience training end users on how to use complex hardware and/or software products, or providing support to end users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join Helsing and work with world-leading experts in their fields&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helsing’s work is important. You’ll be directly contributing to the protection of democratic countries while balancing both ethical and geopolitical concerns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The work is unique. We operate in a domain that has highly unusual technical requirements and constraints, and where robustness, safety, and ethical considerations are vital. You will face unique Engineering and AI challenges that make a meaningful impact in the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our work frequently takes us right up to the state of the art in technical innovation, be it reinforcement learning, distributed systems, generative AI, or deployment infrastructure. The defence industry is entering the most exciting phase of the technological development curve. Advances in our field of world are not incremental: Helsing is part of, and often leading, historic leaps forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In our domain, success is a matter of order-of-magnitude improvements and novel capabilities. This means we take bets, aim high, and focus on big opportunities. Despite being a relatively young company, Helsing has already been selected for multiple significant government contracts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We actively encourage healthy, proactive, and diverse debate internally about what we do and how we choose to do it. Teams and individual engineers are trusted (and encouraged) to practise responsible autonomy and critical thinking, and to focus on outcomes, not conformity. At Helsing you will have a say in how we (and you!) work, the opportunity to engage on what does and doesn’t work, and to take ownership of aspects of our culture that you care deeply about.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-we-offer&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3238&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;6afa48f9-b797-428b-aa69-0bc8163b3593&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;6afa48f9-b797-428b-aa69-0bc8163b3593&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A focus on outcomes, not time-tracking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive compensation and stock options&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relocation support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Social and education allowances&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regular company events and all-hands to bring together employees as one team across Europe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A hands-on onboarding program (affectionately labelled “Infraduction”), in which you will be building tooling and applications to be used across the company. This is your opportunity to learn our tech stack, explore the company, and learn how we get things done - all whilst working with other engineering teams from day one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Helsing is an equal opportunities employer. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, religion, sexual orientation, age, marital status, disability or gender identity. Please do not submit personal data revealing racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, religious or philosophical beliefs, trade union membership, data concerning your health, or data concerning your sexual orientation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Helsing&#39;s Candidate Privacy and Confidentiality Regime can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://helsing.ai/candidate-privacy-and-confidentiality-regime/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

mbaexchange-adasia:greenhouse:7532690.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are seeking a Sales Manager to join our China Outbound team, supporting Chinese game developers and agencies in expanding into key Asian markets, including Japan, Korea, Hong Kong, and Southeast Asia.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you will drive new business within the China gaming sector and act as a strategic partner to clients, delivering high-quality influencer marketing and branding solutions. You will work closely with global internal teams to ensure smooth execution and drive profitable growth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Market Penetration: Identify, target, and secure partnerships with China-based game developers and agencies looking to launch or grow their titles in Japan, South Korea, and other Asian markets.&lt;br&gt;- Business Development: Proactively contact new and existing clients/agencies to educate them on our cross-border marketing solutions. Leverage your existing network within the Chinese gaming industry to secure high-value contracts.&lt;br&gt;- Strategic Consultation: Develop a deep understanding of the client’s game mechanics, target audience, and marketing objectives to propose tailored influencer marketing and branding strategies that resonate with JP/KR audiences.&lt;br&gt;- Full-Cycle Sales Management: Manage the entire sales process from prospecting and pitching to negotiation and closing, ensuring a consistent pipeline to meet and exceed Gross Profit targets.&lt;br&gt;- Cross-Regional Collaboration: Act as a solid bridge between Chinese clients and our regional execution teams, ensuring local market insights (JP/KR) are accurately translated into client success.&lt;br&gt;- Industry Leadership: Stay ahead of gaming trends in Asia (e.g., Subculture/ACGN trends in Japan, MMO trends in Korea) and act as a thought leader for digital marketing within the China outbound community.&lt;br&gt;- Operational Excellence: Provide professional, high-touch service in responding to RFPs and customized requests, ensuring a seamless onboarding experience for new clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Experience: 4+ years of experience in digital media sales, with a proven track record in branding marketing or influencer marketing.&lt;br&gt;- Strategic Clients: Demonstrated experience in managing Tier-1 strategic accounts (major game publishers/developers) and navigating high-level decision-making processes.&lt;br&gt;- Industry Expertise: Deep knowledge of the China Outbound Gaming ecosystem, specifically for markets like Japan and South Korea.&lt;br&gt;- Strategic Selling: Strong ability to understand client needs and deliver innovative, customized branding solutions (not just standard packages).&lt;br&gt;- Communication: Excellent pitching, negotiation, and interpersonal skills. Must be proactive with strong follow-through.&lt;br&gt;- Languages: Native Mandarin and professional English (written &amp;amp; spoken). Proficiency in Japanese or Korean is a strong plus.&lt;br&gt;- Adaptability: Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment and manage multiple high-priority accounts simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Advanced AI Tools For All Positions&lt;br&gt;- Competitive Salary&lt;br&gt;- Performance Review ( 2 times per year )&lt;br&gt;- Performance Bonus ( 1 time per year from 0.5-month to 3-month salary amount )&lt;br&gt;- Comprehensive Leave Package&lt;br&gt;- Pet-Friendly Workplace&lt;br&gt;- Wellness and Fitness Allowance&lt;br&gt;- Dedicated Engagement &amp;amp; Collaboration Sessions&lt;/p&gt;

mbaexchange-adasia:greenhouse:7959963.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a People Partner Manager will act as a strategic HR business partner, executing people initiatives business leaders, with a strong focus on Talent Management, Organization Development, and leadership capability building. This role will drive people strategies that strengthen organizational effectiveness, employee engagement, performance culture, and succession readiness, while partnering closely with business leaders to support sustainable growth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partnering &amp;amp; People operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with the Head of People in executing people initiatives and day-to-day HR partnering activities across assigned departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor on organizational structure, workforce planning, team effectiveness, and people-related challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute organizational transformation initiatives, change management, and culture-building activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insights and recommendations based on people data, engagement trends, attrition analysis, and workforce metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Management &amp;amp; Organization Development (OD)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and execute talent review and succession planning processes for key positions and high-potential employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement talent management frameworks, including performance calibration, career development, and internal mobility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leaders to identify capability gaps and build development plans for critical talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor retention trends and do execution of retention initiatives for key talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare talent reports, workforce data, and people insights for business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and coordinate performance review cycles, including timeline tracking and process communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with managers to strengthen performance culture and accountability within teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Head to advise business leads/ managers on feedback conversations, performance improvement planning, and people development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify leadership pipeline risks and recommend development or succession actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate talent discussions and people review sessions with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote continuous feedback culture and manager effectiveness practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree is required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 6–8 years of HR experience, with strong exposure in HRBP, Talent Management, Organization Development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the Digital Marketing, E-commerce industry is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior stakeholders and business leaders in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open mindset toward AI adoption and digital transformation in HR practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong growth-mindset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Result-driven and have a good sense of responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good command of English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Review (2 times per year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual Leave: 15 days and 8 paid sick leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TGIF, monthly birthday, and other fun events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MacBook to be provided&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good chance to explore new trends in the digital market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to learn and work with the most advanced advertising technology platforms&lt;/li&gt;
