&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to get back to your why - join BAYADA&#39;s nursing team and work 1:1!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Laurel Highlands Offices are interested in a Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) who has a passion for pediatric care to join our Skilled Nursing team. We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with &lt;em&gt;compassion, excellence, and reliability&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
