&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in threat modeling risks to corporate infrastructure and driving the implementation of prevention first architectures and controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills to work with a range of partners from engineering to legal across a global footprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a rapidly evolving environment and dealing with ambiguity&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
